            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.16.1

- Fades are smoother in Apple Music, Spotify and your browser, and only the music fades, not other sounds.
- Focus filters now hide the widget and pause music, and music resumes when the Focus ends.
- The keyboard's play/pause key can fade too. Turn it on in Settings.
- Hovering a full screen lyric now highlights it like the line being sung.
]]></description>
